rsa560_solver -- RSA-560 (c169) GNFS solver for Enigma SN63 "Breaking RSA"
================================================================================

Our own code (pipeline_c169/, the gpu/*_patch.py patchers, gpu/sqrt_l00.hpp, Dockerfile) is under the MIT License
in LICENSE. This submission also contains, or builds, the following third-party software:

1. CADO-NFS, Cognition Research tree (third_party/cado-nfs-public/)
   https://github.com/cognition-research/cado-nfs-public, commit b5ca9c4fd3e331edc8978f93830f8de1e8dda70c
   (tag `latest`, 2026-09-25). Includes gpu-siever/ (glas-gpu, the GPU lattice siever, and gps1, the GPU
   polynomial selection) and gf2x. License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later -- the full text is in
   third_party/cado-nfs-public/COPYING and the authors are listed in third_party/cado-nfs-public/AUTHORS.
