   (the submission zip may not contain symlinks). The Docker build then modifies it with these patches, all
   shipped here in source form:
     pipeline_c169/vendor/cado-symlink-writethrough-cognition.patch, gpu/sqrt_l00_patch.py (+ gpu/sqrt_l00.hpp),
     gpu/chars_pre_patch.py, gpu/glas_adjust_patch.py, gpu/glas_coprime_patch.py, gpu/glas_prefetch_patch.py,
     gpu/glas_xfuse_patch.py, gpu/glas_region_patch.py, gpu/glas_xfgrid_patch.py, gpu/glas_session_patch.py,
     gpu/glas_narrow_patch.py, gpu/glas_p1_patch.py, gpu/glas_empty_pattern_patch.py, gpu/gps1_stats_patch.py,
     gpu/gps1_fastsort_patch.py.
   The modified files keep the LGPL-2.1+ license. gpu_mul.so is built from sqrt/gpu_mul.cu of the same tree.

2. Enigma challenge SDK (engine/enigma_challenges/), https://github.com/qbittensor-labs/enigma, MIT License,
